@baseUrl = http://localhost:5071
@eventGridToken = {{$processEnv EVENTGRID_DEMO_TOKEN}}
@acsToken = {{$processEnv ACS_DEMO_TOKEN}}
@routeId = replace-with-the-route-id-issued-for-your-test-call

### Safe in configuration-preview mode; contains no customer or credential data
GET {{baseUrl}}/demo
Accept: application/json

### Development OpenAPI
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi/v1.json

### Harmless Event Grid subscription validation (live configuration must be enabled)
POST {{baseUrl}}/events/incoming-call
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "id": "validation-example",
    "eventType": "Microsoft.EventGrid.SubscriptionValidationEvent",
    "subject": "demo",
    "eventTime": "{{$datetime iso8601}}",
    "dataVersion": "1.0",
    "data": { "validationCode": "echo-this-code" }
  }
]

### Incoming-call shape. Normally delivered by Event Grid, not called manually.
### WARNING: valid live credentials/context can answer a real billable call.
### Keep tokens in environment variables; never commit them to this file.
POST {{baseUrl}}/events/incoming-call
Authorization: Bearer {{eventGridToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "id": "incoming-example",
    "eventType": "Microsoft.Communication.IncomingCall",
    "eventTime": "{{$datetime iso8601}}",
    "subject": "demo",
    "dataVersion": "1.0",
    "data": {
      "incomingCallContext": "replace-with-fresh-ACS-context",
      "serverCallId": "replace-with-ACS-server-call-id",
      "from": { "kind": "phoneNumber", "rawId": "4:+15555550101", "phoneNumber": { "value": "+15555550101" } },
      "to": { "kind": "phoneNumber", "rawId": "4:+15555550102", "phoneNumber": { "value": "+15555550102" } }
    }
  }
]

### Lifecycle callback shape; normally signed and delivered by ACS.
POST {{baseUrl}}/automation/callbacks/{{routeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{acsToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "id": "callback-example",
    "source": "acs",
    "specversion": "1.0",
    "type": "Microsoft.Communication.CallConnected",
    "time": "{{$datetime iso8601}}",
    "data": {
      "callConnectionId": "replace-with-ACS-connection-id",
      "serverCallId": "replace-with-ACS-server-call-id"
    }
  }
]

### Expected 400 for an authenticated non-WebSocket request (401 without a valid ACS JWT).
### ACS itself establishes the real WSS connection; REST Client does not stream call audio.
GET {{baseUrl}}/automation/media/{{routeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{acsToken}}

### Negative: missing Event Grid authentication must not answer a call
POST {{baseUrl}}/events/incoming-call
Content-Type: application/json

[{"id":"unauthorized","eventType":"Microsoft.Communication.IncomingCall","eventTime":"{{$datetime iso8601}}","subject":"demo","dataVersion":"1.0","data":{}}]
